<title>Mexico's cartel violence: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mexico/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mexico-2026-11-22T08:19:02.412Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 08:19:02 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Mexican special forces captured cartel leader El Chapo Isidro in northern Sinaloa after a firefight that left 11 dead. The raid sparked gun battles, vehicle burnings and gunshots that disrupted a local baseball match. The capture has triggered renewed violence linked to the Sinaloa cartel and increased migrant caravan movements toward the U.S. border. 37 battle-related deaths were recorded in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/21/alleged-mexican-drug-cartel-boss-el-chapo-isidro-meza-flores-arrested&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/21/world/americas/mexico-captures-drug-kingpin.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ckz749ey0r75o?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxPZHBDbG9GYkxsaWpTYlVjUlZpYzJlcmI4SHI5VzFWVGJyd3U5NUlwcUxGNzFrelVYODMwSDgwaERhRHhWV2U4VDgxY3B5V1ZkMk9UQUp6ckk1b0Y1Ml92dUIyWTdBUXZJUkxOU3BmY21CXzRnMXZ1WjR4bmRobW1QZmdiMzNtZ2xSNTRYcmVsV2dHdk5NeTA3OV9uV25jc1p3eWphX0ZuakgwSkQtMHNnVFhycw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxQa1lhc2ZRS3hPcnFWc3VBdDBIbElGZF9PSlZVSEV4NFNxSXZ1YlZWeWtYUVdrbjZXVXFJM3V6VkgzLTZGSWdWUFZiVGctOFRreU1lUWpWdXp5VmJxYTFBVU9wTk9YcTZNSmt6MDhsNnB6azlRSnVnaUdZNF83dl9Gay1OVm9qQ2NreElTT1EzVFF2STVySzRkQmt3M19lRjlzQjJvVWVQckYzR21YUVRyY1R0MGJNYzJwaVhR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ft.com/content/90a8d0bd-32c8-471a-8696-